    "clinicbench.adapters.dcitl_port.parse_time",
    "clinicbench.adapters.dcitl_port.Driver.resolve_appt"
   ],
   "attribution": null,
   "cause": "parse_time only recognizes am/pm suffixes and ignores 'in the afternoon', so it parses '3:30 in the afternoon' as '03:30' instead of '15:30'. Driver.resolve_appt then finds no appointment matching '03:30' and returns 'not_yours', causing Driver.cancel to tell the patient the appointment isn't under their record while listing the 15:30 appointment."
  },
  {
   "kind": "finding",
